  "description": "This package provides robust implementations extending the core repository abstractions for Entity Framework Core (EF Core), emphasizing the utilization of long integers as auto-generated database IDs. Drawing upon the foundational principles of its precursor, this toolkit facilitates .NET developers with streamlined methods to work with databases where entities' identifiers are auto-managed long integers. A meticulously crafted solution by Inoxie, tailored for projects that employ database-managed long identifiers.",
